  "synthetic": true,
  "provenance": {
    "note": "synthetic; JSON-LD offers[] lists a 3rd-party marketplace offer priced far from the live buy-box CSS price the shopper actually sees — extract_jsonld only reads offers[0], so JSON-LD alone would silently report the wrong seller's price without ranking"
